{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "main_14_level_main_14-02_end",
  "groupId": "main_14",
  "stageId": "main_14-02",
  "title": "Hammer and Anvil, Vanquished",
  "storyCode": "14-3",
  "avgTag": "After Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_14-02_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "b4db1a5fe84415cf74eed9327c25ffcef358a88e44abafb299e4e998f086ae4d",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Twenty-three hours into the operation..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The route ahead has been cleared."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'll continue scouting the Sarkaz army's movements. Haven't found any trace of them yet."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Thank you, Misery. Continue to set up those sentry posts."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Morgan, found any surviving Victorian soldiers where you're at?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Morgan",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm afraid not."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Morgan",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Nothing but Originium crystals here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Morgan",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We haven't run into any Victorian troops, corpses, or wrecks since we entered the Westbound Forest."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Indra",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Dammit! We can tell there's been a bloody huge battle, so where've all the people gone?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dagda",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The terrain here keeps changing. Maybe the ground... ate them all up."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We cannot underestimate the tenacity of the people. It is only because there are those who refuse to give up that the Exemplars even exist."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's why we're here in the first place."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Shearer, keep the medics ready to receive any army remnants and civilians."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shearer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We've got extra supplies, so no need to worry on that front."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shearer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The bad news is that with so many Infected among our troops now, it's almost impossible to distinguish between infected and uninfected soldiers."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'd like your professional opinion on that matter. Would registering the Infected help our men or not?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shearer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Funny you should ask. 'Registering the Infected'... That might have been the first thing they taught me at the military academy."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shearer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But where we stand now, I'd say there's no real sense to it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I see. Then let's stop registering them."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Just try your best to provide everyone, infected or not, with Rhodes Island's recommended protective measures."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The rest... is not up to us anymore, at least not for now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Let's all focus on surviving this war first. Then we can worry about the wars to come."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rockrock",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Oh, my drone's back."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rock-18",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rockrock",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "How awful, the entire propulsion system has been clotted up by crystal dust."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rockrock",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Based on monitored data, environmental Originium concentration is still fluctuating wildly."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Send me that data you just got, Rockrock. We've got a new iteration of our Originium activation trend model, and I want to see if our calculations fit real-world data."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ugh, looks like there's not enough data to do that. The trend of this curve... Let's wait for Viktor's team to finish off that diffractometer analysis report, then we should be able to calculate the safe areas in real-time."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "This place freaks me out. It's like one minute it's deadly quiet, the next there's some terrifying Originium mountain pushing its way up out of the dirt. The safe areas keep changing."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Although we've managed to reestablish short-range comms after working our asses off, if you go even a step out of range, all that interference'll just get in the way again."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Good thing I planned ahead and asked Raidian for her Arts Unit before we left for Londinium. After a little copy and paste, I made a knockoff version. It's not as good as the real deal, but it should help."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Once we've got these portable communications towers up, we'll be able to transmit the locations of the safe areas to anyone on the battlefield who needs them."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "This information will save many lives."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Well, yeah. That's what Rhodes Island does."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Horn, status update."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We've successfully arrived at Gibsonham. It's the last supply point before we reach the front at Silverrock Bluffs."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The reconnaissance team's already made their initial scouting report. Looks like there are traces of the ducal armies here. Must have passed through on the way to the front a few days ago."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I think we can confirm at this point that the route Trilby Asher provided is safe."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Is there anyone in town?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The streets are empty, but I can sense the flicker of shadows and the smell of food."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We decided against contact to avoid unneeded misunderstandings."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Understood. We'll rendezvous with you as soon as we can."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's getting dark."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Seems like everything's going smoothly. Best we let our fighters get some rest and some hot soup in them."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Remember to save some for my team! They'll be taking a while longer to get back after their work is done. Rockrock and I still have to head over to Feist..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm not sure if we'll be able to double our communication range by nightfall, but we'll do our best to finish ASAP."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No need to worry, we'll save the best for your people."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...It's all just the same canned provisions though, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rockrock",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Would you like some engine oil for dressing then?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Oi!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege & Rockrock",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hahahahaha!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "All units, continue onwards until you reach Gibsonham."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I hope things can be as peaceful tonight as things are now."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "All the houses seem to be empty. Have the residents gone into hiding?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Delphine",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Gibsonham's not far from the dukes' defense line, so I doubt the Sarkaz ever fully captured it, not to mention that the ducal armies just passed through a few days ago."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Delphine",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Horn's caution is warranted, though. There might be some scattered ducal troops who want to reconvene with the main army and decided to camp out here first."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Delphine",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Although Trilby Asher's helping us out with his advice, Victoria's never exactly been a model for unity."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Delphine",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Not to mention the... complicated nature of the Exemplars. I dare say there are a few old-fashioned military nobles who would rather not tolerate our very existence."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I see, then let's show them the full scale of our forces. It'll deter those with ulterior motives and alert anyone who needs our help of our arrival."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The rumbling of traveling tanks reverberates through the quiet night, the low roar of the engines forceful yet steady.\nThe soldiers cautiously advance, observing their surroundings, but still, all they see are pitch-black windows and doorways."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Delphine",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It doesn't look like they want to make first contact."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That's fine, as long as it means we can get along—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Wait, I hear something. From the building to the front and left."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That's the sound of artillery shell casings falling on the ground!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "An ambush?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "On your guard, everyone. I'll lead a team to scout ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "First Squad, Second Squad, follow my lead!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "There are no signs of life in the abandoned factory.\nContrary to expectation, there is no sound of an explosion following the fallen casings."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Delphine",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Are you sure that was falling casings, Horn?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Absolutely sure. That's a special model only allocated to elite Victorian troops."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No traces of anyone living here—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Don't move, Siege."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Siege carefully puts her foot down back to where it was.\nHorn points at a thin tripwire, barely visible against the ground."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Nicely concealed, what with the surrounding piping obstructing the view. Real tricky to spot."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "A booby trap?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No... It's not linked to any explosives, just a simple alarm system. Based on how they've installed it, I'd say they're military."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Delphine",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Should we try to initiate contact?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yes. Everyone, get behind us, and prepare to engage."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Delphine",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hello, we don't mean any harm!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Delphine",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Our unit's called the—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "A secret passage!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Get ready to enter! Stay behind my shield!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Halt!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We're not..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Victorian Soldier?",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Victorian Soldier?",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "H-Help!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Injured Soldier",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I knocked over some spent ammunition while on watch. How could they have heard from so far away?! They avoided your alarm, too!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Injured Soldier",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "These troops, I don't think they're any ordinary—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Injured Soldier",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "She... She can block your piledriver spear?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bagpipe",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bagpipe",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Captain? And Siege too?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It really is you, Fiona."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The lady with long, red hair suddenly throws herself into the arms of her captain."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bagpipe",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "So ye were alive all along..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bagpipe",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Wonderful... how wonderful."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Horn gently releases Bagpipe from her embrace, then claps a hand on her shoulder."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Good to see you in one piece, and in rather good shape, too."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bagpipe",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I-I'll make my report now, Captain! I've done it, I've managed tae extract the intelligence on the Spectre Force, and I ken what they're plannin' now!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bagpipe",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I survived! I got my memories, I got the truth, and I stayed alive!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bagpipe",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yer orders... I never forgot a word of 'em."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Good to hear. I knew you could do it. I always knew."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Welcome back, Bagpipe."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Injured Soldier",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Wait, she's...? You're not—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Delphine",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Everyone, we mean you no harm. It's alright to come out."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "One by one, silhouettes emerge from the shadows.\nThe elderly, children, the sick and the wounded, civilians.\nHundreds of pairs of eyes stare at Siege and her men in fear and curiosity, taking their measure."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Injured Soldier",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You're not with the ducal armies?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Injured Soldier",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "M-Most of you aren't dressed like Victorian soldiers. In fact, you mostly look like workers to me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That's right. We're not under any of the dukes."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We're called the Exemplars."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Shearer's counting up the civilians who were hiding in the factory and giving them a check-up. All he can say at the moment is that it's looking better than we expected."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Aside from those infected soldiers under the Duke of Fife who came along with you, and a small team of military engineers under the Duke of Normandy, everyone else is just local civilians who couldn't escape."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The ducal alliance armies came through here a few days ago, but they rather give up a chance at being rescued than seek help from the Grand Dukes."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dagda",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's understandable why the soldiers would avoid them. They're either worried about the status of their infection, or worried about a court-martial. But as for the civilians..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dagda",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Perhaps this was the year the people living around Londinium got to reassess their country and those decorated higher-ups."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Bagpipe, how did you manage to get their trust—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Are you listening, Bagpipe?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bagpipe",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bagpipe",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Huh? Oh, er, aye, Captain!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You need to pay attention during tactical meetings. The map's on the wall, not my face."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bagpipe",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Sorry, Captain!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Horn lets out a small sigh."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "*sigh* I really shouldn't be asking. You are Fiona, after all."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bagpipe",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hehe."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bagpipe",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm just... a wee bit glad."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bagpipe",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The Exemplars, the Tempest Platoon's predecessors. I guess the rumors were true."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm actually amazed that you still remember what you learned in military history class."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bagpipe",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Well of course! When I was still at trainin' camp, Triangle made sure I committed this fact to memory!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bagpipe",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Out by the trainin' field, the sycamores were full o' leaves, blockin' the sun juuust right. Then there were the rocks at the top of the cliff, hard as, well, rocks. Hand'll sting if ye tried to climb them."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I remember when Cello and Oboe had a wager on who could complete the rock climbing training course the fastest. The loser had to do a hundred one-handed push-ups."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bagpipe",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Oboe was a right fool! Who would've taken that bet wi Cello?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Maybe you should have reminded him back then. You were even sitting on his back the whole time he was doing those push-ups."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bagpipe",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hehe. I was just helpin' him with his training. And I'd say it turned out alright in the end, aye? He was just a hair behind Cello the next time!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bagpipe",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The Exemplars... When the Tempest Platoon was first established, nothing was left of this legendary unit from the War of the Four Nations, not even its unassigned unit ID."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But now, it has returned once more to the battlefield."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We're all members of the Exemplars now, Bagpipe."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "As long as our team is still here, we will never stop fighting the good fight."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Delphine",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Isn't there a strategy meeting inside? Why're you standing out here in the cold?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Just wanted to clear my head for a few minutes."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Delphine",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Did you think I was someone else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Delphine",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Baird, or..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No, not really."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Delphine",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I believe you. If someone suddenly popped out of the fog tonight, I wouldn't have any expectations either."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Delphine",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Not everyone is as lucky as Horn, reuniting with the person they most want to see."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "'Luck' eh? That's a luxury around here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That's enough blues for tonight. We should head inside."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Wait."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Delphine",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Victorian soldiers? Are they the remnants who stayed behind?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Delphine",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No, they can't be. I never noticed them until they got this close."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Delphine",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "They're the elite of the elites."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Delphine",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Caster's men?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ah! It's positively frigid out here! My hands are frozen stiff."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The days truly are getting colder as they go by."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Why, I've only taken a little jaunt, and my full plaid's already half soaked through."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Duke of Gododdin",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "My young friends, won't you invite me inside to warm my hands for a spell?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Since you've come all this way in person, I suppose we should show you some courtesy."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Delphine—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Delphine",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yes, Vina?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Let's show the duke the way."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
